{"conversation": [{"role": "owner", "text": "People visiting our town cannot find the independent art studios. I want to give them a guide on their phones."}, {"role": "assistant", "text": "{\"question\":{\"text\":\"What information should visitors find in the phone guide: studio locations and opening hours, directions, events, or something else?\",\"decision\":\"This determines whether an existing map or guide can meet the need, or whether a custom guide needs additional features.\"},\"owner_view\":\"You want visitors to find independent art studios in your town using their phones. I need to know what the guide should show before recommending software. A town map or existing website may be enough if visitors mainly need locations and opening hours; other features could require a different tool. Costs, data handling, and upkeep depend on that choice.\",\"developer_view\":{\"disposition\":\"needs_answer\",\"goal\":\"Help town visitors find independent art studios using a phone-friendly guide.\",\"users\":[\"Town visitors\",\"Guide maintainer not yet identified\"],\"requirements\":[\"Provide a guide accessible on phones\",\"Help visitors locate independent art studios\"],\"constraints\":[\"Plan only; no implementation or external action\"],\"data_access\":[\"Studio locations and any other guide information are not yet specified\",\"Who can add or update studio information is unknown\"],\"risk\":{\"level\":\"unknown\",\"reasons\":[\"Guide content, maintenance arrangements, and access needs are not yet known\"]},\"recommendation\":{\"summary\":\"Defer a specific software recommendation until the needed guide information is clear; an existing map, website, or manual guide may suffice.\",\"rationale\":[\"The request establishes a phone guide and a discovery problem, but not the required features.\"],\"alternatives\":[\"Use an existing town or map service if locations and basic details are enough\",\"Use a simple phone-friendly webpage or directory if existing tools do not