ude a small map\",\"Display photographs supplied for public use\"],\"constraints\":[\"Plan only; no implementation or external action\"],\"data_access\":[\"Studio names, public opening hours, locations, and publicly supplied photographs\",\"Who may add or update listing information and photos is unknown\"],\"risk\":{\"level\":\"medium\",\"reasons\":[\"Out-of-date hours or locations could mislead visitors\",\"Photo publishing depends on clear permission for public use\",\"Maintenance and access arrangements are not yet known\"]},\"recommendation\":{\"summary\":\"First check whether an existing town website, map, or directory can present the requested information on phones; if not, consider a simple phone-friendly webpage or directory.\",\"rationale\":[\"Six listings with hours, a small map, and photos are modest requirements that may fit existing tools.\",\"A custom app is not established as necessary.\",\"Ongoing accuracy depends on a named maintainer.\"],\"alternatives\":[\"Use an existing town website or map service if it supports the listings and photos\",\"Create a simple mobile-friendly webpage or directory if existing tools do not fit\",\"Use a maintained printed guide alongside an online map\"]},\"assumptions\":[\"All six studios and their submitted photographs are intended for public display\",\"Visitors can use ordinary phone browsers or map links\"],\"open_questions\":[\"Is there already a town website, map, or directory that the guide could use?\",\"Who will maintain the studio listings and verify changes to hours, locations, and photo permissions?\",\"Should visitors get directions or only see the small map?\"],\"acceptance_criteria\":[\"Visitors can open the guide on a phone\",\"All six studios have accurate public hours and locations\",\"The small map is understandable on a phone\",\"Displayed photographs have permission for public use\",\"A maintainer can update information when it changes\"],\"owner_responsibilities\":[\"Identify the existing town tools that may host or link to the guide\",\"Assign someone to maintain listings, hours, locations, and photos\",\"Confirm public-use permission for supplied photographs\"]}}"}, {"role": "owner", "text": "I do not know."}, {"role": "assistant", "text": "{\"question\":{\"text\":\"Who will keep the studio hours, locations, and photographs up to date?\",\"decision\":\"A guide needs someone to verify changes and handle photo-use permissions; knowing who will do that helps determine whether an existing tool or a new page is manageable.\"},\"owner_view\":\"The guide can stay simple: six studio listings with public hours, a small map, and photographs supplied for public use. You do not yet know whether the town has an existing site or directory for it, so that remains open. Someone will need to maintain the information. A custom app is not yet justified; likely options are an existing town service or a basic phone-friendly webpage. Costs and photo handling depend on the option chosen.\",\"developer_view\":{\"disposition\":\"needs_answer\",\"goal\":\"Help visitors find six independent art studios using a phone-friendly guide with public opening hours, a small map, and photographs supplied for public use.\",\"users\":[\"Town visitors\",\"Guide maintainer not yet identified\"],\"requirements\":[\"List six studios with public opening hours\",\"Show a small map and photographs supplied for public use\",\"Make the guide usable on phones\"],\"constraints\":[\"Plan only; no implementation or external action\",\"Whether the town has a suitable existing website, map, or directory is unknown\"],\"data_access\":[\"Studio names, locations, public hours, and photographs intended for public use\",\"Who may edit the guide and how photo permission will be confirmed are unknown\"],\"risk\":{\"level\":\"medium\",\"reasons\":[\"Out-of-date hours or locations could mislead visitors\",\"Public display of photographs depends on clear permission\",\"No maintenance arrangement is known\"]},\"recomme