{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"question\":{\"text\":\"Do any photos currently display on the frame? If so, do you know what file type they are, such as JPG or PNG?\",\"decision\":\"A working example can reveal a compatible format even if the frame’s model and manual are unavailable.\"},\"owner_view\":\"You want to prepare a folder of scanned recipe cards for one adult to use on one laptop. The scans must stay on the laptop, and the workflow should not require an account. The frame’s requirements are still unknown, so I can’t yet recommend a specific tool. Knowing whether any existing photos work may help identify a format it accepts.\",\"developer_view\":{\"disposition\":\"needs_answer\",\"goal\":\"Prepare a folder of scanned recipe cards so an older digital photo frame can display them.\",\"users\":[\"One adult preparing and viewing the recipe card scans.\"],\"requirements\":[\"Prepare all images in a folder for the frame.\",\"Keep the scans on the laptop without uploading them or creating an account.\"],\"constraints\":[\"The frame rejects many scanned images.\",\"The frame’s supported formats and image size limits are unknown.\",\"Use one laptop; its operating system is unknown.\"],\"data_access\":[\"Recipe card scans will be accessed on the laptop; their current formats, location, and sensitivity are unknown.\",\"The owner says scans should not be uploaded.\"],\"risk\":{\"level\":\"unknown\",\"reasons\":[\"The frame’s compatibility requirements are unknown.\",\"The scans’ contents and sensitivity are unknown.\",\"Converting without preserving originals could reduce quality or lose content.\"]},\"recommendation\":{\"summary\":\"No software recommendation yet. First check whether a photo that already works on the frame can reveal a compatible file type; then choose a local workflow for the laptop.\",\"rationale\":[\"A known working example may clarify compatibility without requiring the frame model.\",\"The no-upload and no-account requirements point toward using laptop tools or local software, if conversion is needed.\"],\"alternatives\":[\"If no photos currently work or their file type is unknown, use the frame’s settings or documentation to find accepted formats and size limits.\",\"If the accepted format is already supported by the laptop, try an existing local image tool before considering additional software.\"]},\"assumptions\":[\"The owner wants to prepare existing scans rather than replace the frame or create a new display system.\",\"A local workflow is preferred to meet the stated no-upload and no-account requirements.\"],\"open_questions\":[\"Do any photos currently display on the frame, and if so, what file type are they?\",\"What operating system does the laptop use?\",\"What formats are the scans currently in?\",\"Should originals remain unchanged?\",\"What image size limits does the frame accept, if known?\"],\"acceptance_criteria\":[\"All selected images display on the frame.\",\"Preparation uses the laptop without uploading scans or requiring an account.\",\"Original scans remain recoverable if preparation changes image quality or content.\"],\"owner_responsibilities\":[\"Identify a photo that already displays on the frame and its file type, if possible.\",\"Keep a backup of the original scans before conversion.\",\"Later identify the laptop operating system and the scans’ current formats if those details are needed.\"]}}"}}
