rds or original receipts may complicate warranty claims.\"]},\"recommendation\":{\"summary\":\"Provisionally use an existing phone app with offline saving and attachment support, then confirm laptop access after synchronization. Treat receipts and photos as potentially personal and restrict access. No custom app is indicated by the known needs.\",\"rationale\":[\"The record is limited to one person and one bicycle, with common fields and attachments.\",\"Offline phone entry and later laptop review are the main tool requirements.\",\"Costs, sync behavior, attachment limits, and recovery vary by app and storage plan and cannot be determined from the available information.\"],\"alternatives\":[\"A spreadsheet with a linked folder for receipts and photos, if the chosen apps handle offline edits and synchronization reliably.\",\"A bicycle maintenance app if it supports offline entry, required fields, attachments, laptop access or export, and usable recovery.\",\"A paper log with separately retained receipts and photos if digital access is not essential.\"]},\"assumptions\":[\"It is acceptable to add records offline and have them appear on the laptop after connectivity returns.\",\"An existing app or service may be used if it supports the needed devices and record format.\"],\"open_questions\":[\"Which phone and laptop operating systems and apps are available remains unknown.\",\"Budget, attachment storage costs, backup preferences, and whether original receipts must be retained remain unknown.\",\"Whether receipts or photographs contain personal details remains unknown; treat them as potentially personal.\"],\"acceptance_criteria\":[\"Each repair can be recorded with date, mileage, notes, and part names.\",\"Receipts and photos can be associated with and found alongside the relevant repair.\",\"A phone entry made without reception remains saved and becomes available on the laptop after synchronization.\",\"The owner understands the selected app's storage costs and can recover records and attachments if a device is lost.\",\"Sharing is limited to people the owner intends to have access.\"],\"owner_responsibilities\":[\"Keep repair details and mileage current.\",\"Retain original receipts and warranty paperwork when needed for claims.\",\"After selecting a tool, verify offline saving, later synchronization, laptop access, storage limits, costs, and recovery arrangements.\",\"Use account access controls and avoid sharing attachments unless intended.\"]}}"}}
