ess and workflow needs.\"]},\"assumptions\":[],\"open_questions\":[\"Who should be able to view or edit the list, and how should current section leaders access it?\",\"What contact details are included, and who maintains their accuracy?\",\"What tools does the orchestra already use for shared files or contacts?\",\"How should access be removed when leaders rotate out?\"],\"acceptance_criteria\":[\"Current authorized section leaders can access the accurate list when needed.\",\"Access is limited to the intended people and can be updated as leaders rotate.\"],\"owner_responsibilities\":[\"Identify the intended viewers and editors.\",\"Determine what information belongs on the list and who will keep it accurate.\",\"Choose an owner to update access when section leadership changes.\"]}}"}}
