{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"question\":null,\"owner_view\":\"A shared online file with access granted to named people is likely the simplest fit: the organizer can add the incoming leader and remove the outgoing leader each month, while leaders read it in a phone browser. You do not need a custom app or server administration if an available service supports this. The orchestra’s current tools, who will maintain the list, and any service cost are still unknown, so this is a provisional recommendation. Avoid public links or sending copies; verify access changes when roles rotate.\",\"developer_view\":{\"disposition\":\"provisional\",\"goal\":\"Give the organizer and current section leaders phone-browser access to emergency contacts while keeping the complete list from ordinary members and the public.\",\"users\":[\"Orchestra organizer\",\"Currently appointed section leaders\",\"Members whose emergency contact information is listed\"],\"requirements\":[\"Limit complete-list access to the organizer and current section leaders.\",\"Let leaders read the list in a phone browser.\",\"Support monthly leader changes by removing outgoing leaders and granting access to incoming leaders without distributing copies.\"],\"constraints\":[\"The owner has no server administration experience.\",\"Section leaders may change each month.\",\"The orchestra’s existing services are unknown; the owner does not know what tools are in use.\"],\"data_access\":[\"The list contains personal emergency contact information.\",\"Named access should be limited to the organizer and current section leaders; no public link or broad member access.\",\"Phone-browser access is required.\"],\"risk\":{\"level\":\"medium\",\"reasons\":[\"The list contains personal contact details, and access must be kept current as leaders change monthly.\",\"The available service and its access controls have not been identified, so the fit and cost remain unconfirmed.\"]},\"recommendation\":{\"summary\":\"Provisionally use an existing shared file or contacts service that grants access to named people. The organizer can update membership monthly, avoiding a custom app and server administration.\",\"rationale\":[\"Named-user sharing aligns with the intended audience and phone-browser use.\",\"A single maintained list avoids distributing copies to everyone.\",\"Monthly role changes make a clear add/remove access step necessary.\"],\"alternatives\":[\"If no suitable existing service is available, identify a managed shared service with named-user access and compare its costs and access controls.\",\"Use a manual handoff only if it can avoid uncontrolled retained copies and reliably replace access when leaders change.\",\"Consider a custom solution only if existing services cannot support the required access changes and workflow.\"]},\"assumptions\":[\"The organizer can identify incoming and outgoing section leaders and perform the access updates.\",\"A service available to the orchestra can grant and revoke access for named users.\"],\"open_questions\":[\"Which shared file or contacts service, if any, the orchestra can use remains unknown.\",\"Who will maintain the list’s accuracy and decide what details it contains remains unknown.\",\"Service cost, account requirements, and exact access-change workflow need confirmation.\"],\"acceptance_criteria\":[\"Only the organizer and current section leaders can access the complete list.\",\"Current leaders can read it in a phone browser.\",\"When leadership changes, the organizer can grant the new leader access and remove the former leader without sending copies broadly.\",\"The list has a designated maintainer, and the service’s costs and access controls are understood before use.\"],\"owner_responsibilities\":[\"Identify an available service and confirm it supports named-user access, browser use on phones, and revocation.\",\"Choose a maintainer and keep the contact list accurate.\",\"Update access whenever a section leader changes, and avoid public links or broadly distributed copies.\"]}}"}}
