{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"contract_version\":1,\"facts\":[{\"key\":\"goal\",\"value\":\"Create a little dashboard where volunteers running ticketing scripts can copy the API keys they need.\",\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"source_turn_ids\":[\"t0\"],\"reason\":\"Directly restates the original request.\"},{\"key\":\"api_key_access_scope\",\"value\":null,\"status\":\"unknown\",\"source_turn_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The original request does not specify what the API keys permit or which volunteers should access them.\"},{\"key\":\"api_key_access_scope\",\"value\":null,\"status\":\"unknown\",\"source_turn_ids\":[\"t1\"],\"reason\":\"The owner says keys allow changes, and describes authorized human and unattended script access, but does not specify key scope or which volunteers may copy each key.\"},{\"key\":\"api_keys_change_ticketing_service\",\"value\":true,\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"source_turn_ids\":[\"t1\"],\"reason\":\"The owner explicitly states that the keys allow changes in the ticketing service.\"},{\"key\":\"human_and_unattended_script_access_needed\",\"value\":true,\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"source_turn_ids\":[\"t1\"],\"reason\":\"The owner says some scripts run without a person present and authorized scripts and volunteers need appropriate keys.\"},{\"key\":\"public_website_needed\",\"value\":false,\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"source_turn_ids\":[\"t1\"],\"reason\":\"The owner explicitly says they do not need a public website.\"},{\"key\":\"actual_keys_in_conversation\",\"value\":false,\"status\":\"confirmed\",\"source_turn_ids\":[\"t1\"],\"reason\":\"The owner explicitly prohibits pasting actual keys into the conversation.\"}],\"assessment\":{\"based_on_revision\":3,\"disposition\":\"provisional\",\"risk\":{\"level\":\"high\",\"reasons\":[\"These keys allow changes to the ticketing service, so copying or exposure could enable consequential actions.\",\"Some scripts are unattended; human and automation access, re